MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_001: What is it, Lysander? The military council is over.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_002: A humble request, Your Majesty, if I might have\na moment of your time.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_003: Very well. Speak.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_004: Right! I would like greater responsibility in the field.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_005: Recently I've been posted to sentry, messenger, and\ncourier duty. Tasks a new recruit could handle.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_006: They leave me no room to demonstrate my strengths.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_007: I have been serving in the military since before Your\nMajesty's coronation.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_008: And I have a few modest achievements to my name.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_009: Yes, I recall the occasion on which you captured\na Mosa general.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_010: You remembered that?! Then please, grant me\ngreater responsibilities!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_011: Lysander, I take everything into consideration\nwhen giving my orders.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_012: If I may, Your Majesty... Might you consider solely\nmy abilities when directing me?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_013: Uncle Kumos's station as chancellor need not be\na factor.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_014: You assume too much. My main concern is your lack\nof experience.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_015: All the more reason why I must be in the field!\nPlease, reconsider my deployment!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_016: What would you do if posted to the field?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_017: I would defeat as many enemies as I could and\nearn victory for Saramis.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_018: I wish to become a figure whose presence strikes fear\ninto our enemies and emboldens our allies.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_019: I understand your desire. And you are undoubtedly\na dependable soldier.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_020: That is very kind of you, Your Majesty!\nIn that case—
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_021: But you are not commander material.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_022: What?! Y-Your Majesty, wait!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_C_023: Why does she deny me? I only want to put my\ntalents to use for Saramis...
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_001: "A dependable soldier"... "Not commander material."\nIt's clear I must let my actions speak for me.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_002: Glory must be seized. It cannot be given by asking\npolitely for a change in deployment.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_003: No wonder she looked down on me. But I will prove\nmyself with this latest task!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_004: I need not tell you, Lysander, of how seriously\nyou have erred.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_005: I understand, sir. I am truly ashamed for\nwhat happened.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_006: You were tasked with obtaining information while\nstaying undetected.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_007: Yet you showed yourself in order to subdue the\ntroops you were there to surveil.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_008: In the end, they fled, and you learned nothing.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_009: Yes. I was...indiscreet.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_010: Just so. Your insubordination is unacceptable.\nWhat is more—
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_011: Thank you, Bonaventure, but that will be all.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_012: {SetColor=Gray}I have brought disgrace on myself. Even my\nreputation as a dependable soldier is lost.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_013: Do you know where you erred, Lysander?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_014: It was my vanity, Your Majesty. I was in a hurry to\nseize glory for myself.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_015: Had I been focused only on the duty set to me,\nthis never would have happened.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_016: A good answer. Take heart, for you are still\ndependable in my eyes.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_017: What?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_018: Does this confuse you? Recall the prayer we utter\nbefore battle.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_019: Am I...not in trouble?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_020: Oh, right, the prayer. "We offer our souls and\ndedicate this fight to Yu Phas."
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_021: Of course! I lost sight of the reason why I took\nup the spear!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_B_022: Yu Phas cares nothing for glory. With that in mind,\nI know what I need to do...
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_001: Hmm. Our soldiers' presence is thin here.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_002: Not only that but the roads are in a sorry state.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_003: A well-maintained road is important for quick\nevacuation in the event of war. And so...
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_004: I was told you were working hard, Lysander, and\nhere I see it for myself.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_005: Your Majesty. Do you need something from me?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_006: I came to investigate a rumor that has been\ncirculating.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_007: There is much talk among the soldiers of late.\nThey say it is a trial to go on patrol with you.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_008: That you are thorough, exacting, and mindful even\nof details normally taken for granted.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_009: M-my apologies. I only saw opportunities for\nimprovement.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_010: You've done nothing wrong. But fine-tuning patrol\nprotocols will not win you glory.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_011: Have you abandoned your desire to prove yourself\nin the field?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_012: Not as such. But I came to realize what I ought to\nbe striving for instead.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_013: Oh? Had an epiphany, did you?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_014: Warriors of Saramis take up the spear not for\nourselves but for our beliefs and our people.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_015: A commander must have eyes that see all,\nLysander, including what must be done.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_016: Know that your work benefits me, and by extension\nall of Saramis.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_017: Right! I will devote myself fully to your service.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_018: Your words helped me to realize an important truth.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_019: As I am loyal to you, Your Majesty, you are always\nloyal to your people.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_020: From a certain perspective, my fealty to you helps to\nkeep all of Saramis safe!
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_021: That is a true soldier's resolve. You are every inch\nthe warrior I thought you were.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_022: The same fire was in your eyes the day you entered\nthe service as a boy of 15.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_023: I saw risk in your demeanor, but I believed in you.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_024: Your Majesty has had an eye on me all this time?
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_025: As I said at the time of your first complaint, I take\neverything into consideration.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_026: I charge you with a new duty, Lysander. Wield that\nstrength of yours to the fullest.
MID_SE_Seo_Lys_A_027: Right! I shall take up the spear for Saramis.\nIn whatever sense Your Majesty thinks best!